<Namespace Name="Java.Time.Temporal">
  <Docs>
    <summary>Provides date and time fields, units, adjustments, queries, and week definitions.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Use <see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.ITemporalAccessor" /> to read fields and <see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.ITemporal" /> to adjust dates and times. <see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.ChronoField" /> and <see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.ChronoUnit" /> define standard fields and units. <see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.TemporalAdjusters" /> and <see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.TemporalQueries" /> provide common adjustments and queries.</para>
      <para><see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.WeekFields" /> defines localized week rules. <see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.IsoFields" /> provides ISO quarter and week-based-year fields. <see cref="T:Java.Time.Temporal.JulianFields" /> provides day counts based on the local date.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/fff4fcc0cf7f080cf2511cbb57561482b13b218f/ojluni/src/main/java/java/time/temporal/package-info.java" title="Android package documentation">Source for the namespace overview.</a></format></para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
</Namespace>
